,{"target":"ancrel.8091","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-cc90c1dc133cd22a"},{"target":"ancrel.8092","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-bd907480b34fc043"},{"target":"ancrel.8093","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-b6990f22401ffca8"},{"target":"ancrel.8100","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-abe6c93e9ba79d94"},{"target":"ancrel.8101","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-119d6e320e24449b"},{"target":"ancrel.8102","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-b083ff7ad43a1502"},{"target":"ancrel.8103","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-51397d56bf8fc81c"}],"readings":[]},{"id":"ancrel.108","title":{"zh":"古战场遗址","en":"Ancient Battle Site"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们发现了被精炼过的矿物，虽然进一步研究亟待展开，但是我们初步认为这是一个巨型战场遗址。看起来，其中一方进行了轨道空降并与星球上的防御军发生了交火。进攻方为什么没有进行轨道轰炸？最后的胜利者究竟是谁？一切都悬而未决。","en":"The refined material has been uncovered, and while further study is needed, our initial impression is that this is the remains of a vast battle site. It appears that one side descended from orbit and was engaged by planetbound defenders. Why there was no orbital bombardment and who the victor was remains unclear."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":"art/b82ccadbb11e902954ad.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"令人好奇。","en":"Curious."},"conditional":false,"next":[]}],"next":[],"readings":[]},{"id":"ancrel.109","title":{"zh":"被遗忘的怨恨","en":"Forgotten Grudge"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们得出结论，来自“毁灭者”，即一族高维游牧民的军队入侵了[From.Planet.GetName]，入侵时此行星属于“抵抗组织”，一个由数个不同物种组成的联盟。通过零散的记录，我们认定这场战争主要是在星系的其他部分进行，而[From.Planet.GetName]是抵抗组织寄希望于在“毁灭者”的魔爪之外建立一个秘密殖民地的尝试。这场战役和战争整体的结果仍不得而知，但对战争机器残骸的研究已经获得了一些有价值的信息。","en":"We have concluded that forces from \"The Destroyers\", a race of extra-dimensional nomads, invaded [From.Planet.GetName], which at the time belonged to \"Those-who-resist\", a coalition of several different species. From scattered records we believe that that the war was mostly fought elsewhere in the galaxy and [From.Planet.GetName] was an attempt by Those-who-resist to establish a secret colony outside the reach of The Destroyers. The outcome of this battle and the larger war remains unknown, but study of the wrecked war machines has yielded some valuable information."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":"art/9dd0e3e6ffcf359310be.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"棒极了。","en":"Excellent."},"conditional":false,"next":[]}],"next":[],"readings":[]}]}